usage: j3c new [name] [--app | --lib | --template fps|ui]
    j3c new mygame        printLn hello in ./mygame
    j3c new mygame --app  SDL window (links SDL2)
    j3c new mygame --template fps   first-person 3D game with a scene (SDL2 + GL)
    j3c new mygame --template ui    .j3ui components window (SDL2 + ttf + GL; `j3c doc j3ui`)
    j3c new               write into the current directory
    j3c new --app         window template in the current directory
    j3c new hello --lib   a package other projects import (`use hello;`; `j3c doc packages`)
    j3c new --lib         make the project here a package (adds [lib]; moves nothing)
--- stderr
--- exit 0
